msgctxt "view:mobile.payment.pay.result:"
msgid ""
"Press Verify Payment once the customer has paid. The scheduler also verifies"
" every few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Peze « Verifye peman an » le kliyan an fin peye. Planifikatè a verifye tou "
"chak kèk minit."

msgctxt "view:mobile.payment.pay.start:"
msgid ""
"Choose the operator, check the amount and request the payment. The customer "
